            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EThe \u003Ca href=\u0022/competitions/hailsham-mixed-league\u0022\u003EHailsham Mixed League\u003C/a\u003E would like to hear from any teams interested in playing this season. Matches are on Thursday evenings and the current teams are Burwash, Herstmonceux, Five Ashes and Yew Tree (Chalvington). Teams would need to be ready to play by the end of May at the latest.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv\u003EAny interest, queries or questions please contact\u00A0Peter Coleman at\u00A0\u003Ca rel=\u0022noopener\u0022 href=\u0022mailto:Coleman_p@sky.com\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EColeman_p@sky.com\u003C/a\u003E or on\u00A007711 297678.\u003C/div\u003E"
