    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[The Hailsham Mixed League would like to hear from any teams interested in playing this season. Matches are on Thursday evenings and the current teams are Burwash, Herstmonceux, Five Ashes and Yew Tree (Chalvington). Teams would need to be ready to play by the end of May at the latest.]]></Value>
